Xisto<\/strong> e as <strong>Aldeias Hist\u00f3ricas de Portugal<\/strong> num ambiente de pura supera\u00e7\u00e3o f\u00edsica e mental.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com dist\u00e2ncias que v\u00e3o desde a exigente prova de inicia\u00e7\u00e3o <strong>OMD 20K<\/strong> at\u00e9 \u00e0 colossal jornada de sobreviv\u00eancia <strong>OMD 200K<\/strong>, passando pelos desafios de <strong>50 km<\/strong>, <strong>100 km<\/strong> e pelas emblem\u00e1ticas <strong>100 Milhas (160 km)<\/strong>, o evento testa os limites da resist\u00eancia humana em trilhos t\u00e9cnicos de altitude, vales glaciares e desn\u00edveis brutais. Integrada nos circuitos oficiais de ultra trail e com atribui\u00e7\u00e3o de pontos de qualifica\u00e7\u00e3o, a prova oferece uma estrutura log\u00edstica de excel\u00eancia com bases de vida, postos de controlo e seguran\u00e7a permanente nas montanhas mais imponentes de Portugal continental.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(25