#94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 1 Mai \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: A definir \u2022 4500m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Abertura de Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es:<\/strong> A confirmar<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Brevemente)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Ultra<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">OMD 50K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 1 Mai \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: A definir \u2022 2300m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Abertura de Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es:<\/strong> A confirmar<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Brevemente)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">OMD 20K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 2 Mai \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: A definir \u2022 800m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Abertura de Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es:<\/strong> A partir de 31.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Brevemente)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data oficial e o local de realiza\u00e7\u00e3o do Oh Meu Deus 2027?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se entre 30 de abril e 2 de maio de 2027, tendo como quartel-general e centro nevr\u00e1lgico o concelho de Seia, no Parque Natural da Serra da Estrela.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no programa do evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Oh Meu Deus disponibiliza 5 desafios de montanha: OMD 200K (200 km), OMD 160K (100 milhas \/ 160 km), OMD 100K (100 km), OMD 50K (50 km) e OMD 20K (20 km).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funcionam as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e onde consultar a tabela de pre\u00e7os?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o efetuadas exclusivamente na plataforma oficial da Horizontes (horizontes.pt), com pre\u00e7os a partir de 31 \u20ac para as dist\u00e2ncias de inicia\u00e7\u00e3o e fases detalhadas disponibilizadas com a abertura das candidaturas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Por que locais e serras passa o itiner\u00e1rio da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O percurso cruza o maci\u00e7o central da Serra da Estrela, estendendo-se \u00e0s Serras do A\u00e7or e da Lous\u00e3, interligando trilhos selvagens, Aldeias de Montanha, Aldeias do Xisto e Aldeias Hist\u00f3ricas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que tipo de apoio e assist\u00eancia \u00e9 fornecido aos atletas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o garante bases de vida com alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o quente e \u00e1reas de descanso para as dist\u00e2ncias maiores, m\u00faltiplos postos de abastecimento interm\u00e9dios, controlo eletr\u00f3nico de passagens e equipas de socorro m\u00e9dico de montanha.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Oh Meu Deus - Ultra Trail Centro de Portugal 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-05-02\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Seia, Serra da Estrela\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Seia\", \"addressRegion\": \"Guarda\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Horizontes\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data oficial e o local de realiza\u00e7\u00e3o do Oh Meu Deus 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se entre 30 de abril e 2 de maio de 2027, tendo como quartel-general e centro nevr\u00e1lgico o concelho de Seia, no Parque Natural da Serra da Estrela.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no programa do evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Oh Meu Deus disponibiliza 5 desafios de montanha: OMD 200K (200 km), OMD 160K (100 milhas \/ 160 km), OMD 100K (100 km), OMD 50K (50 km) e OMD 20K (20 km).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funcionam as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e onde consultar a tabela de pre\u00e7os?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es s\u00e3o efetuadas exclusivamente na plataforma oficial da Horizontes (horizontes.pt), com pre\u00e7os a partir de 31 \u20ac para as dist\u00e2ncias de inicia\u00e7\u00e3o e fases detalhadas disponibilizadas com a abertura das candidaturas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Por que locais e serras passa o itiner\u00e1rio da prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O percurso cruza o maci\u00e7o central da Serra da Estrela, estendendo-se \u00e0s Serras do A\u00e7or e da Lous\u00e3, interligando trilhos selvagens, Aldeias de Montanha, Aldeias do Xisto e Aldeias Hist\u00f3ricas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Que tipo de apoio e assist\u00eancia \u00e9 fornecido aos atletas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o garante bases de vida com alimenta\u00e7\u00e3o quente e \u00e1reas de descanso para as dist\u00e2ncias maiores, m\u00faltiplos postos de abastecimento interm\u00e9dios, controlo eletr\u00f3nico de passagens e equipas de socorro m\u00e9dico de montanha.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":67287,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,497,622,498,499],"event_type_2":[212,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-67286"